
---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="錦乃｜はじまり｜WORKS"
  description=""
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->
  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
    alt=""
    class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <!-- Dark Overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f6f1e7]/85 via-[#f6f1e7]/45 to-transparent"></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->
        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          First
        </p>

        <!-- Title -->
        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[36px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          はじまり
        </h1>

        <!-- Gold Divider -->
        <div class="mt-1">
          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->
        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">

        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <!-- Scroll -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- Introduction -->
<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->
  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

      </div>

      <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

      <!-- Information -->

      <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

        <!-- Left -->

        <div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

            <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

            <p
              class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
              style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
            >
              HISTORY
            </p>

          </div>

          <h2
            class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            一番最初の記録
          </h2>

          <p
            class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            2012年2月26日、初めてMinecraftを遊んだ日の記録。<br>
            当時DSiLLで撮影した映像や写真で、修理したiphone4sの中にかろうじて残っていました。<br>
            小さい頃は友達とフラッシュゲーム漁りするのが好きだったので新しいゲームを探していた時にMinecraftに出会いました。<br>
            最初に触れたのは、PC Gamer読者向けに無料配布されている
            「Minecraft PC Gamer Demo」。<br>
            2011年6月に公開された体験版であり、うちが始めた頃はリリースからまだ約8か月ほどしか経っていませんでした。バージョンはBeta 1.3。<br><br>

            こののち、スマートフォン版の「Minecraft Pocket Edition」0.2.1に触れます。<br>
            期間を開けながら数年間遊び続け、Version 0.17.0までスマートフォンでMinecraftの世界を楽しみました。

            <br><br>

            その間、Java Editionも触れていてVersion 1.2、1.5.2、1.7.10など、それぞれ人気大型アップデートをリアルタイムで体験。

            2020年の夏よりワールドデータをjava版に移行し、以降2024年よりJava版で建築を始めました。

            <br><br>

            幼い頃に興味を持って触れたゲームでしたが、まさか十数年後の人生に大きな影響を与えることになるとは想像もしていなかったです。幼い頃の自分に今の自分のこと話したらびっくりするんだろうなぁ......

          </p>

        </div>

        <!-- DATA -->

        <aside class="relative">

          <div
            class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
          >

            <p
              class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
              style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
            >
              DATA
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">記録日</p>
                <p class="text-base">2012年2月26日</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">ゲームバージョン</p>
                <p class="text-base">Minecraft PC Gamer Demo　Beta 1.3</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">最初の制作</p>
                <p class="text-base">ダムのような水路</p>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

        </aside>

      </div>

<!-- Gallery -->

<div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

  <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

    <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

    <p
      class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      GALLERY
    </p>

  </div>

  <h2
    class="mt-6 text-4xl"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    展示写真
  </h2>

  <div class="gallery mt-12">

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/11.png"
        alt=""
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/12.jpg"
        alt=""
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/13.png"
        alt=""
      />
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

    </div>

    <!-- Back -->

    <div class="mt-24">

      <a
        href="/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 戻る
      </a>

      <a
        href="/nishikinoedocastle1/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        最古の作品 →
      </a>

      <!-- Share -->

      <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          作品をシェア
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <a
            href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=%E9%8C%A6%E4%B9%83%E3%80%8C%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%81%BE%E3%82%8A%E3%80%8D%20%7C%20WORKS&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nishikinolab.net%2Ffirst%2F"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            URLをコピー
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>

<script>
  const pageUrl = "https://www.nishikinolab.net/first/";

  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {
        copyButton.textContent = "コピーしました";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "URLをコピー";
        }, 2000);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(error);
    }
  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Instagramでシェア
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            この作品ページのURLをコピーして<br>
            Instagramを開きます。
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            URLをコピーしてInstagramを開く
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            キャンセル
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
    const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
    const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();
    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      overlay?.remove();
    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        overlay.remove();
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

0%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
}

100%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

}

section{
position:relative;
}

section::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
position:sticky;
top:120px;
height:max-content;
}

a{
transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

section{
overflow:hidden;
}

}

@media(max-width:900px){

aside{
position:relative;
top:auto;
}

}

@media(max-width:768px){

section:first-child{
height:760px;
}

h1{
font-size:44px !important;
line-height:1.15;
}

h2{
font-size:32px !important;
}

.work-hero{
animation:none;
}

}

/* =========================================================
   GALLERY GRADIENT FRAME
   写真ごとのグラデーション縁取り
========================================================= */


.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>